1850
01:21:37.830 --> 01:21:45.350
And it is about my dear friend, Andrea Gibson of 25 years, the poet laureate of the state of

1851
01:21:45.350 --> 01:21:49.010
Colorado, who has stage four ovarian cancer.

1852
01:21:49.270 --> 01:21:53.210
And this film is so beautiful.

1853
01:21:53.210 --> 01:22:00.370
