1854
01:22:00.370 --> 01:22:05.030
It's produced by, you know, Glennon Doyle, Abby Wambach.

1855
01:22:05.190 --> 01:22:05.330
Yeah.

1856
01:22:05.530 --> 01:22:08.450
Sarah Bareilles, Brandi Carlile.

1857
01:22:09.150 --> 01:22:09.270
Wow.

1858
01:22:09.410 --> 01:22:12.070
Everybody's just massive Andrea Gibson fans.

1859
01:22:12.070 --> 01:22:23.390
This person is, it's poetry that is so accessible that will inspire you and destroy you and make

1860
01:22:23.390 --> 01:22:25.830
